sentences.text:
The applicant is directed to be released on bail FIR No. 33/2023 dated 08.01.2023, under Section 376 IPC and Section 4 of POCSO Act, registered at Police Station - Samaipur Badli, Delhi subject to the following terms and conditions:
(a) The applicant shall furnish a personal bond in the sum of Rs. 5,000/-
(Rupees Five Thousand only) with 01 surety each in the like amount, to the satisfaction of the trial Court;
(b) The applicant shall not leave the country and if the applicant has a passport, he shall surrender the same to the trial Court;
(c) The applicant shall furnish to the IO/SHO concerned his cellphone number on which the applicant may be contacted at any time and shall ensure that the number is kept active and switched-on at all times;
(d) The applicant shall not indulge in any act or omission that is unlawful or that would prejudice the proceedings in pending cases, if any;
(e) The applicant shall appear before the Court as and when directed; and (f) The applicant or his family members/relatives/friends will not contact or try to intimidate the complainant or her family or tamper with any of the witnesses and evidence in anyway.

